"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"87*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"node_scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-LAX-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-DFW-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"otd_target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.93</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"band\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"promise_low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"promise_high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"postal_patterns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"59*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"82*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"83*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"node_scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-DFW-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-NJ-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"otd_target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"band\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"D\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"promise_low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"promise_high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"postal_patterns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"995*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"996*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"997*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"node_scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-LAX-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-NJ-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"otd_target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.85</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"exclusions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"remote_postal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"995*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"996*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"997*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"band D 的承诺不含处理时长\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份表里 <code>quantile_source</code> 记录了承诺的推导依据（近 28 天线路实测 p95），这是让承诺变更可审计的字段——当有人要求把某档从 3–5 天改成 2–4 天时，第一个问题就是「实测 p95 支持吗」。<code>grace_days</code> 把处理时长与承运时长分开：买家看到的承诺是两者的和，但内部归因时必须分开，因为超时发生在处理环节还是运输环节，对应完全不同的整改动作。<code>exclusions</code> 记录例外区，例外区是客服与法务最关心的部分——没有显式例外表的承诺表在纠纷中站不住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量-承诺达成率与它的三个口径\">度量：承诺达成率与它的三个口径</h2><p>「承诺达成率」这个词在不同团队嘴里常常指不同的东西，导致同一个网络在不同报表上表现不同。三个口径必须分开定义、分开报告：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>常见偏差来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承诺达成率（OTD）</td>\n<td>在承诺区间内签收的订单占比</td>\n<td>对外/对客质量</td>\n<td>承诺区间宽窄直接影响数值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约及时率</td>\n<td>在内部目标时点前出库的订单占比</td>\n<td>对仓内作业</td>\n<td>与承诺无关，仓内可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次承诺准确率</td>\n<td>首单承诺与实际一致、无需改期的占比</td>\n<td>对系统与前端</td>\n<td>含取消、改单、地址异常</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者的关系是：履约及时率是承诺达成率的上游（仓内不及时则必然超时），而承诺达成率是首次承诺准确率的下游。视图上三者必须同时看——只看 OTD 会掩盖「承诺写得过宽所以达成率高」的情况。</p>\n<h3 id=\"因果归因\">因果归因</h3><p>OTD 恶化时，归因要按「承诺是否合理」与「执行是否到位」两条线分叉。一个可操作的判据是<strong>比较实际时效分布与承诺所依据的历史分布</strong>：若实际分布的 p95 明显右移（线路真的变慢了），则是网络或承运问题；若实际分布与历史分布一致但承诺区间偏窄，则是承诺口径问题。这个判据可以用一个简单的对比实现——把承诺档位、承诺所依据的分位数、当期实测分位数放在同一张对照表里：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 承诺一致性体检：每档的承诺区间 vs 依据分位 vs 当期实测&#10;WITH current AS (&#10;  SELECT p.band,&#10;         p.promise_high,&#10;         p.otd_target,&#10;         -- 承诺依据：建表时的分位（存在 promise_table.generated_from 快照里）&#10;         ref.p95_days      AS ref_p95,&#10;         -- 当期实测：近 28 天实际签收时效的 p95&#10;         PERCENTILE_CONT(0.95) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY s.transit_days) AS cur_p95,&#10;         AVG(CASE WHEN s.transit_days &lt;= p.promise_high THEN 1.0 ELSE 0.0 END) AS otd_actual,&#10;         COUNT(*) AS n_orders&#10;  FROM   promise_bands p&#10;  JOIN   promise_snapshots ref ON ref.band = p.band AND ref.version = p.version&#10;  JOIN   shipments s ON s.postal_prefix = ANY(p.postal_patterns)&#10;                     AND s.shipped_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;28 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP  BY p.band, p.promise_high, p.otd_target, ref.p95_days&#10;)&#10;SELECT band, promise_high, ref_p95, cur_p95,&#10;       otd_target, otd_actual, n_orders,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN cur_p95 &gt; ref_p95 + 1 THEN &#39;network_degraded&#39;&#10;         WHEN otd_actual &lt; otd_target - 0.03 AND cur_p95 &lt;= ref_p95 THEN &#39;promise_too_tight&#39;&#10;         WHEN otd_actual &gt; otd_target + 0.05 THEN &#39;promise_too_loose&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;ok&#39;&#10;       END AS verdict&#10;FROM   current&#10;ORDER  BY band;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 承诺一致性体检：每档的承诺区间 vs 依据分位 vs 当期实测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promise_high</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">otd_target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         -- 承诺依据：建表时的分位（存在 promise_table.generated_from 快照里）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p95_days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref_p95,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         -- 当期实测：近 28 天实际签收时效的 p95</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         PERCENTILE_CONT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">transit_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur_p95,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">transit_days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promise_high</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otd_actual,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   promise_bands p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   promise_snapshots ref </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   shipments s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">postal_prefix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ANY(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">postal_patterns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipped_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'28 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP  BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">band</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promise_high</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">otd_target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p95_days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> band, promise_high, ref_p95, cur_p95,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       otd_target, otd_actual, n_orders,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur_p95 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref_p95 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'network_degraded'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otd_actual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otd_target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">03</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur_p95 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref_p95 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'promise_too_tight'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otd_actual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otd_target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">05</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'promise_too_loose'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ok'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> verdict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   current</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER  BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> band;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段查询输出的是<strong>每一档的判决</strong>，而不是一个总体数字。四类判决对应四种不同的动作：<code>network_degraded</code> 走网络侧（检查该档对应节点的产能与承运商表现），<code>promise_too_tight</code> 走承诺侧（放宽区间或改善路由），<code>promise_too_loose</code> 走增长侧（可以收紧承诺以提升转化），<code>ok</code> 无需动作。把判决粒度做到档位级别是关键——总体 OTD 达标但某一档持续超标的情况非常常见，而总体数字会把它完全掩盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承诺变更的发布纪律\">承诺变更的发布纪律</h2><h3 id=\"为什么承诺不能像内部参数一样随时改\">为什么承诺不能像内部参数一样随时改</h3><p>承诺一旦对买家展示，就进入了合同与合规范畴：它出现在商品页、订单确认页与客服话术里，可能构成对消费者的明示保证；在某些司法辖区，未达成明示承诺可能触发消费者保护法下的责任。因此承诺变更必须是<strong>有版本、有生效日、有公告</strong>的动作，而不是改一个配置就生效。</p>\n<p>三条落地纪律。<strong>其一，变更要区分收紧与放宽</strong>：放宽承诺（写更长的时间）对买家不利但降低赔付风险，通常需要公告并在一定周期内生效；收紧承诺（写更短）对买家有利，风险较低但必须确认网络真的支撑得住，否则是把风险从「承诺过宽」换成「承诺过紧」。<strong>其二，已经在途的订单沿用下单时的承诺</strong>：承诺是订单属性而不是全局参数，改动必须作用到新订单，已下单订单的承诺快照不能被覆盖——这是最基本也最常被违反的一条。<strong>其三，变更前必须跑仿真</strong>：任何承诺改动都应当先在网络仿真里评估对 OTD 与赔付的影响（见 <a href=\"../network-simulation-scenario/demand-lane-simulation\">需求/线路网络仿真</a>），而不是上线后观察。</p>\n<h3 id=\"承诺快照\">承诺快照</h3><p>实现上，承诺必须在下单时被<strong>快照</strong>到订单上，而不是每次查询时重新计算。这看起来是明显的工程常识，但它经常被违反，原因是「按当前承诺表展示」在实现上更简单。快照的必要性来自两个方向：买家需要一个稳定的承诺（下单时说 3 天，三天后查询还应该是 3 天），以及归因需要一个稳定的基准（评价这次履约是否及时，必须对照下单当时的承诺）。承诺表本身的版本管理与其生效机制，见 <a href=\"../../fulfillment-delivery-engineering/\">履约配送工程</a> 与订单追踪相关的设计。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE order_promise_snapshot (&#10;  order_id        BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  promised_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  promise_version TEXT NOT NULL,             -- promise_table.version 快照&#10;  promise_low     INT  NOT NULL,&#10;  promise_high    INT  NOT NULL,&#10;  band            TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  handling_days   INT  NOT NULL,&#10;  node_id         BIGINT NOT NULL,           -- 下单时路由到的节点&#10;  snapshot_reason TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;initial&#39;,&#10;  CONSTRAINT order_promise_snapshot_reason&#10;    CHECK (snapshot_reason IN (&#39;initial&#39;,&#39;address_change&#39;,&#39;manual_override&#39;))&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> order_promise_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  promised_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  promise_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- promise_table.version 快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  promise_low     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  promise_high    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  band            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  handling_days   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  node_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 下单时路由到的节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'initial'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_promise_snapshot_reason</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (snapshot_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'initial'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'address_change'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'manual_override'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>snapshot_reason</code> 这一列处理的是「承诺允许在什么情况下变化」——地址变更会导致覆盖档位变化，人工调整需要一个可审计的理由。所有非 <code>initial</code> 的变更都必须留痕，否则「承诺达成率」这个指标会被改单悄悄污染。<code>node_id</code> 进入快照同样重要：承诺是「这个节点发出、走这条线路」的时效，节点信息丢失后，事后归因时无法判断超时是承诺问题还是路由问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>承诺是网络能力的外化表达，不是配置项；承诺事故多数根因是承诺与网络脱节，而非运营执行不力。</li>\n<li>承诺慢于能力的损失（转化率下降）是隐性的，比承诺快于能力（赔付、差评）更难察觉，因此需要客观规则裁决而非会议决定。</li>\n<li>承诺分位数由履约达成率目标决定而非反过来；分档按承诺区间而非逐邮编区，兼顾精度与可维护性。</li>\n<li>承诺表必须记录推导依据（分位来源）、处理与运输时长拆分、以及显式例外区。</li>\n<li>承诺达成率有三个口径（OTD / 履约及时率 / 首次承诺准确率），必须分开定义；归因要按档位输出判决（network_degraded / promise_too_tight / promise_too_loose / ok）而非一个总体数字。</li>\n<li>承诺变更是有版本、有生效日、有公告的动作；已下单订单沿用下单时的承诺快照，快照需记录版本、档位与路由节点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"仓网与送达承诺一致性","id":"仓网与送达承诺一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：承诺是契约而不是配置项","id":"核心概念-承诺是契约而不是配置项"},{"level":2,"text":"从网络能力到可承诺时效","id":"从网络能力到可承诺时效"},{"level":3,"text":"分位数的选择","id":"分位数的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"承诺表的结构","id":"承诺表的结构"},{"level":2,"text":"度量：承诺达成率与它的三个口径","id":"度量-承诺达成率与它的三个口径"},{"level":3,"text":"因果归因","id":"因果归因"},{"level":2,"text":"承诺变更的发布纪律","id":"承诺变更的发布纪律"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么承诺不能像内部参数一样随时改","id":"为什么承诺不能像内部参数一样随时改"},{"level":3,"text":"承诺快照","id":"承诺快照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"开仓/关仓与迁移决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-warehouse-network-planning/network-simulation-scenario/open-close-warehouse-decision"},"next":{"title":"跨区库存与调拨规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-warehouse-network-planning/network-plan-ops/inventory-straddle-region"}}